# Extra instructions Cloudflare sends to the browser with each file (QA defects D-03 and D-16).
# Cloudflare already adds HSTS and "nosniff" from the dashboard (SSL/TLS, Edge Certificates).
# Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only (QA T-18): a list of where the site may load things from.
# "Report-Only" means the browser BLOCKS NOTHING; it only writes a warning in its console if
# something outside the list loads. Once a few weeks pass with no warnings (site and editor),
# rename it to Content-Security-Policy to enforce it. What each part allows:
#   script-src  our files; the one inline script in index.html (by fingerprint; the build warns
#               if it changes); the editor's script from unpkg (/admin/)
#   style-src   our files; inline styles (animations and the editor set styles directly)
#   img-src     our files; YouTube video covers; GitHub pictures in the editor
#   connect-src our files; Formspree (the booking form); GitHub (the editor saving changes)
#   frame-src   the YouTube player (youtube-nocookie.com)
#   form-action where forms may send: here and Formspree
#
# Block 3, the editor (/admin/): no policy. Decap CMS evaluates code at run time ("eval"),
# which a policy would have to allow for every page. The editor is protected instead by its
# GitHub sign-in and the fingerprint lock on its script (QA D-22). "!" removes a header.
#
# Block 1, every page and file:
# - X-Frame-Options: other websites may not show this site inside a frame (clickjacking).
#   Our own YouTube player still works: that frame goes the other way.
# - Referrer-Policy: other sites see only "jcmuhire.com", never the full address.
# - Permissions-Policy: the site never uses these, so the browser refuses them outright.
#
# Block 2, built code, styles, fonts and photos: their names change whenever their content
# changes, so browsers may keep them for a year without ever showing an old version.
# Keep comment lines out of the indented blocks: there they would be read as headers.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-k8ZoqoS/qHVRhkcvg0oiWri9mxhXHtdBYt1phVUaxW8=' https://unpkg.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://i.ytimg.com https://avatars.githubusercontent.com https://raw.githubusercontent.com; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://formspree.io https://api.github.com https://unpkg.com; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://formspree.io; object-src 'none'

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/admin/*
  ! Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only
